---

<style>
  .psd-item-name {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
</style>
<div class="psd-block">

  <div class="psd-left" style="padding: 20px 80px;">
    <img class="psd-svg" src="/growth-design-site/images/page-hierarchy.svg" alt="页面空间层级示意图" />
  </div>
  <div class="psd-divider"></div>
  <div class="psd-right">
    <div class="psd-item">
      <div class="psd-item-name">背景层</div>
      <div class="psd-item-body">
        <div class="psd-item-question">烘托氛围</div>
        <div class="psd-item-content">弱化细节，烘托氛围，不喧宾夺主。</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="psd-item">
      <div class="psd-item-name">玩法层</div>
      <div class="psd-item-body">
        <div class="psd-item-question">表达玩法概念</div>
        <div class="psd-item-content">占据视觉中心，用玩法主对象帮助用户理解奖励及进度。</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="psd-item">
      <div class="psd-item-name">交互层</div>
      <div class="psd-item-body">
        <div class="psd-item-question">推动行动</div>
        <div class="psd-item-content">悬浮最顶层，用清晰的按钮、入口和状态提示推动行动。</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>
